#: src/omega_serv/interfaces/tui/guide/content/service_et_instances.py:361
#: src/omega_serv/interfaces/tui/guide/content/service_et_instances.py:410
#: src/omega_serv/interfaces/tui/guide/menu_tree.py:86
#: src/omega_serv/interfaces/tui/screens/admin_accounts_screen.py:82
